--- TIM-01, TIM-02, TIM-03, TIM-05..TIM-11, TIM-13: current time shape ---
a time called 'the register' is current time.
If 'the register's type is not "Time (static)" then, Print "ASSERT TIM-03: expected Time (static) got {'the register's type}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-03 ok".
If 'the register's year is less than 2026 then, Print "ASSERT TIM-10: expected at least 2026 got {'the register's year}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-10 ok".
If 'the register's month is less than 1 or 'the register's month is greater than 12 then, Print "ASSERT TIM-09: expected 1..12 got {'the register's month}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-09 ok".
If 'the register's day is less than 1 or 'the register's day is greater than 31 then, Print "ASSERT TIM-08: expected 1..31 got {'the register's day}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-08 ok".
If 'the register's hour is less than 0 or 'the register's hour is greater than 23 then, Print "ASSERT TIM-05: expected 0..23 got {'the register's hour}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-05 ok".
If 'the register's minute is less than 0 or 'the register's minute is greater than 59 then, Print "ASSERT TIM-06: expected 0..59 got {'the register's minute}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-06 ok".
If 'the register's second is less than 0 or 'the register's second is greater than 59 then, Print "ASSERT TIM-07: expected 0..59 got {'the register's second}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-07 ok".
If 'the register's unix is less than 1 then, Print "ASSERT TIM-11: expected at least 1 got {'the register's unix}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-11 ok".
Get current time into 'the tally sheet'.
If 'the tally sheet's unix is less than 'the register's unix then, Print "ASSERT TIM-11: expected at least {'the register's unix} got {'the tally sheet's unix}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-11 ok".
If current time's hour is less than 0 or current time's hour is greater than 23 then, Print "ASSERT TIM-13: expected 0..23 got {current time's hour}", Exit 95. Print "TIM-13 ok".

